==Information==
===Format===
*'''Regular Season:''' ''June 5<sup>th</sup> - June 28<sup>th</sup>''
**Round Robin 
**All matches are {{Ft|3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 4 teams}} advance to '''Playoffs Seeding Decider Matches'''
**{{Bgcolortext|stayup|Next 4 teams}} advance to '''Last Chance Qualifier'''
**{{Bgcolortext|down|Bottom team}} proceed to promotion/relegation for Stage 3
*'''Playoffs Seeding Decider Matches:''' ''July 3<sup>rd</sup> - 5<sup>th</sup>''
**Single Round Robin
**Results of ''Regular Season'' carry over
**All matches are {{Ft|3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|All teams}} advance to '''Regional Playoffs'''
**{{Bgcolortext|byeup|Top 2 teams}} receive a first-round bye
*'''Last Chance Qualifier:''' ''July 3<sup>rd</sup> - 5<sup>th</sup>''
**Double elimination bracket
**All matches are {{Ft|3}}
**{{Bgcolortext|stayup|5th and 6th team from Regular Season}} start from Upper Bracket
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} advance to '''Regional Playoffs'''
**{{Bgcolortext|down|Bottom 2 teams}} proceed to promotion/relegation for Stage 3
*'''Regional Playoffs:''' ''July 10<sup>th</sup> - 12<sup>th</sup>''
**Single elimination bracket
**All matches are {{Ft|4}}
**{{Bgcolortext|up|Top 2 teams}} advance to {{LeagueIconSmall/owcs}} [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2026/Midseason_Championship|Midseason Championship]]
***If '''{{team|Team Falcons}}''' make the top 2, the slot will pass down to {{Bgcolortext|third|3rd}} place due to already having qualified via the EWC Title Defender program.
***If '''{{team|Crazy Raccoon}}''' make the top 2, the slot will pass down to {{Bgcolortext|third|3rd}} place due to already having qualified via {{LeagueIconSmall/overwatch champions series}} [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2026/Champions_Clash|Champions Clash]]
***If '''{{team|Team Falcons}}''' and '''{{team|Crazy Raccoon}}''' both make top 2, the slots will pass down to {{Bgcolortext|third|3rd}} and {{Bgcolortext|fourth|4th}} places due to both teams being qualified via the EWC Title Defender program and {{LeagueIconSmall/overwatch champions series}} [[Overwatch_Champions_Series/2026/Champions_Clash|Champions Clash]]
*'''Hero Bans'''
**Each team bans 1 hero per map, with the ban impacting both teams
**Each ban must be from a different role than the other team's ban
**Teams can only ban a hero once per series, but may repeat a ban from the opposing team
**The higher seeded team or team that has lost the last map chooses to ban first or second

